    "why_it_matters": "Allahabad branch of India's worker-owned coffee co-operative since 1957, on Mahatma Gandhi Marg in Civil Lines. Nehru, Lal Bahadur Shastri, Indira Gandhi, Firaq Gorakhpuri and Harivansh Rai Bachchan all held court here. White-uniformed waiters, Raj-era facade, prices frozen in another decade.",
